The '''Abandoned Quarry''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Dwarven Mines]]. It is the only place where {{Item|Pure Quartz}} can generate.

{{ZoneText|Mine Pure Quartz Ore.|Fish up &2Mithril Grubbers&f.}}

== Accessing ==
The '''Abandoned Quarry''' can be found by going through the rail system from the {{Zone|Upper Mines}}, turning left, and going to {{Coordinates|-145|149|-30}}. Alternatively, the {{NPCSprite|Ticket Master}} and {{NPCSprite|Station Master}} can transport the player for {{coins}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Abandoned Quarry''' is a place where players can mine {{Item|Pure Quartz}} for high quantities of {{Item|Nether Quartz}}. Additionally, {{MobSprite|Mithril Grubber}}s, {{MobSprite|Medium Mithril Grubber}}s, {{MobSprite|Large Mithril Grubber}}s, and {{MobSprite|Bloated Mithril Grubber}}s can spawn here, which can be killed for {{Mithril Powder}}.

{{NPCSprite|Guard Gornum}} can be found at the entrance, explaining how the '''Abandoned Quarry''' is the only place {{MobSprite|Mithril Grubber}}s can be fished. Additionally, the {{Item|Speckled Teacup}} has a {{Green|1}} in {{Yellow|10}} chance to replace a {{Rmt|&6&lGREAT CATCH}}.

